OL,3,GNEWSA'Ketamine left me bedbound ` now I
OL,4,Ahelp addicts'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who got to the point where he
OL,7,Fcould "barely move" due to his ketamine
OL,8,Faddiction is helping others to get
OL,9,Fclean from the drug.
OL,11,FAdam Kennedy, 26, from Scunthorpe, says
OL,12,Fhe "didn't have a life" as he took
OL,13,Fketamine regularly for five years and
OL,14,Fsuffered from very painful bladder
OL,15,Fissues, which eventually left him
OL,16,Fbedbound.
OL,18,FBut he is now an addiction recovery
OL,19,Fworker at ReNew in Hull, supporting
OL,20,Fothers trying to break their ketamine
OL,21,Fhabits.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
